=== Prompt ===
Who is Brellon Ashwick?

=== Response ===
Brellon Ashwick is a fictional character from the video game series, "The Elder Scrolls." Specifically, he appears in "The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim" as a member of the Thieves Guild. Brellon is a Bosmer (Wood Elf) and serves as the guild's fence in Riften. He provides a steady income for the player character if they choose to join the Thieves Guild. However, like many characters in the game, he has a complex backstory and various relationships with other characters in the game world.

